# OS / editor junk
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db_encryptable
__MACOSX/
desktop.ini

# Backups and archives
*.backup
*.bak
*.zip

# Node
node_modules/

# Keep shared project settings, ignore personal editor state
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json

# NOTE ON PSD/ AND documentation/
# Both are tracked already, so listing them here would do nothing — .gitignore
# only affects files git is not yet tracking. They stay in the repo on purpose:
# PSD/ is your purchased template source, and losing it on a fresh clone would
# be worse than the 275 MB it costs.
#
# They must NOT go on the web server, but that is a deployment concern, not a
# git one. The full do-not-upload list is in NEEDS-YOUR-INPUT.md.
